  "premise_review": [
    "DeBruijnNewmanZeroData has an actual equality constraining the imported zero.kind plus time/realPart/imagPart Real annotations. No relation ties those reals to zero.carrier, an analytic function, root or heat parameter. Retain every field in the full independent data command.",
    "The exact by decide proves disequality of two imported enum constructors. Captured root ZeroTypology has nine distinct constructors and a TypedZero record with arbitrary carrier, kind and description; it is not a mathematical zero construction.",
    "DeBruijnNewmanContract has an arbitrary HFunctionFamily Type, a real Lambda annotation and three independent Prop labels without proofs, numerical inequality or PDE definition. Its real Lambda does not give meaning to lambdaNonnegative by name alone.",
    "DeBruijnToLFunctionBridge stores that whole mixed contract, two bare relation Props and a String note. No map between sets/types of analytic zeros is defined. Both complete mixed schemas remain archived.",
    "Root ZeroTypology hint is contextual evidence and is not activated as Core/ZeroTypology. LFunctionZero and HeatEnergyBounds contexts show separate supplied schemas, not a reconstructed environment or an invented cross-provider bridge."
  ],
